# This dir holds PRIVATE SSH includes (work GitHub accounts, servers) that
# ~/.ssh/config pulls in via `Include ~/.ssh/config.d/*.conf`.
#
# Track the folder itself (via this file) so it always exists after stow, but
# ignore every other file so private host configs are never accidentally committed.
# README.md and config.example are whitelisted: tracked docs/template, not real
# includes (SSH only pulls in *.conf, so these names are ignored by ssh but kept by git).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!config.example
